 'title': "ETHISPHERE ANNOUNCES FIFTH THIRD BANK AS ONE OF THE 2023 WORLD'S MOST ETHICAL COMPANIES® FOR THE FOURTH TIME", 'text': "CINCINNATI--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FIFTH THIRD BANK WAS NAMED AMONG ETHISPHERE'S 2023 WORLD'S MOST ETHICAL COMPANIES FOR THE FOURTH TIME."}{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2023-03-13 13:25:00', 'title': 'FIRSTENERGY CORP. DONATION BRINGS NEW POP-UP LIBRARY TO GREATER AKRON', 'text': "ELECTRIC VEHICLE WILL SERVE AS A MOBILE AKRON-SUMMIT COUNTY PUBLIC LIBRARY STARTING IN SPRING AKRON, OHIO , MARCH 13, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- FIRSTENERGY CORP. (NYSE: FE) HAS DONATED NEARLY $46,000 TO THE AKRON-SUMMIT COUNTY PUBLIC LIBRARY (ASCPL) TO FUND A CUSTOMIZED ELECTRIC VEHICLE THAT WILL FUNCTION AS A POP-UP LIBRARY IN THE GREATER AKRON AREA BEGINNING THIS SPRING. THE THREE-WHEELED VEHICLE, CALLED AN ETUK, WILL SERVE AS A MOBILE LIBRARY FOR RESIDENTS, ESPECIALLY CHILDREN, WHO MAY NOT HAVE EASY ACCESS TO THE LIBRARY'S MAIN BRANCHES."}{'symbol': 'FIS', 'date': '2023-03-13 18:35:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: POMERANTZ LAW FIRM INVESTIGATES CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF FIDELITY NATIONAL INFORMATION SERVICES, INC. - FIS', 'text': 'NEW YORK , MARCH 13, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- POMERANTZ LLP IS INVESTIGATING CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF FIDELITY NATIONAL INFORMATION SERVICES, INC. ("FIDELITY NATIONAL" OR THE "COMPANY")\xa0(NYSE:\xa0 FIS).\xa0 SUCH INVESTORS ARE ADVISED TO CONTACT ROBERT S.'}{'symbol': 'FIS', 'date': '2023-03-13 13:19:00', 'title': 'FIDELITY NATIONAL INVESTORS: MAY 5, 2023 FILING DEADLINE IN SECURITIES CLASS ACTION – CONTACT LIEFF CABRASER', 'text': 'SAN FRANCISCO--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $FIS #FIS--FIDELITY NATIONAL INVESTORS: MAY 5, 2023 FILING DEADLINE IN SECURITIES CLASS ACTION – CONTACT LIEFF CABRASER'}{'symbol': 'FIS', 'date': '2023-03-13 12:53:00', 'title': 'FIDELITY NATIONAL INFORMATION SERVICES, INC. (FIS) CLASS ACTION NOTICE: ROBBINS LLP REMINDS INVESTORS OF LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE IN CLASS ACTION AGAINST FIDELITY NATIONAL INFORMATION SERVICES,