 , MARCH 13, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- RALPHS GROCERY COMPANY TODAY ANNOUNCED IT IS SEEKING TO HIRE NEW ASSOCIATES FOR ROLES IN RETAIL, SUPPLY CHAIN AND MANUFACTURING WITH HIRING EVENTS STARTING IN EARLY MARCH. POTENTIAL ASSOCIATES INTERESTED IN PURSUING POSITIONS IN RETAIL ARE INVITED TO LEARN MORE AT IN-STORE WEEKLY HIRING EVENTS EACH TUESDAY FROM 4:00 P.M.'}{'symbol': 'LRCX', 'date': '2023-03-13 06:05:00', 'title': "LAM RESEARCH NAMED AS ONE OF ETHISPHERE'S 2023 WORLD'S MOST ETHICAL COMPANIES®", 'text': "FREMONT, CALIF. , MARCH 13, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LAM RESEARCH CORP. (NASDAQ: LRCX) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS BEEN NAMED AS ONE OF THE 2023 WORLD'S MOST ETHICAL COMPANIES BY ETHISPHERE, A GLOBAL LEADER IN DEFINING AND ADVANCING THE STANDARDS OF ETHICAL BUSINESS PRACTICES."}{'symbol': 'LYB', 'date': '2023-03-13 05:43:00', 'title': 'LYONDELLBASELL ANNOUNCES DECISION TO ACQUIRE MEPOL GROUP', 'text': 'FACILITIES IN POLAND AND ITALY WILL PRODUCE RECYCLED AND POLYMER COMPOUNDS FOR DIVERSE MARKETS ROTTERDAM, NETHERLANDS AND FERRARA, ITALY , MARCH 13, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0LYONDELLBASELL (NYSE: LYB) AND MEPOL GROUP TODAY\xa0ANNOUNCED THEY HAVE ENTERED INTO A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT FOR LYONDELLBASELL TO ACQUIRE MEPOL GROUP, A MANUFACTURER OF RECYCLED, HIGH-PERFORMING TECHNICAL COMPOUNDS LOCATED IN ITALY AND POLAND, CONSISTING OF MEPOL S.R.L. AND ITS SUBSIDIARIES POLAR S.R.L.'}{'symbol': 'MTCH', 'date': '2023-03-13 20:40:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: POMERANTZ LAW FIRM INVESTIGATES CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF MATCH GROUP, INC. - MTCH', 'text': 'NEW YORK , MARCH 13, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- POMERANTZ LLP IS INVESTIGATING CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF\xa0\xa0MATCH GROUP, INC.\xa0("MATCH" OR THE "COMPANY")\xa0(NASDAQ:\xa0MTCH).\xa0 SUCH INVESTORS ARE ADVISED TO CONTACT ROBERT S.'}{'symbol': 'MTCH', 'date': '2023-03-13 13:09:00', 'title': 'MATCH GROUP, INC. (MTCH) CLASS ACTION NOTICE: ROBBINS LLP REMINDS INVESTORS OF LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE IN CLASS ACTION AGAINST MATCH GROUP, 